<title>USA: TABLE - Quebecor Inc unit issues debt.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Quebecor Inc unit issues debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Quebecor Inc unit, Quebecor Printing Inc, was priced on Tuesday via lead manager Salomon Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>Quebecor Inc is a communications group with activities throughout North America and Europe in four sectors. Through its subsidiary, Quebecor Printing Inc, it ranks as the leading commercial printer in Canada and Europe and is the second largest in the United States.</p>
<p>BORROWER QUEBECOR PRINTING</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 06.50	MATURITY  08/01/27</p>
<p>TYPE BONDS	   ISS PRICE 99.728  FIRST PAY DATE</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD  06.549     PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P  BBB-PLUS SPREAD +47 BPS    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>			 VS 7-1/4'S OF 2004</p>
<p>NOTE: BONDS ARE PUTABLE IN THE SEVENTH YEAR (( -- Nancy Leinfuss, U.S. Corporate Bond Unit,</p>
<p>212-859-1675 ))</p>
